      that do exist are the <a href="/">home page</a>, the <a href="/systems/">systems</a>, the{' '}
      <a href="/architecture/">architecture map</a>, the <a href="/decisions/">decisions</a>,{' '}
      <a href="/about/">about</a> and <a href="/colophon/">the colophon</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="static-ledger" data-tone="fault">
      <span>T+00:00.000</span>
      <span>404</span>
      <span>recorded, not retried</span>
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
